c poll, with recent surveys showing margins of 6 to 7 points, and she carries a decisive financial advantage heading into the final stretch. High-profile endorsements, including Barack Obama's, have reinforced her position.\n\nHull has struggled to gain traction, at times campaigning solo after debate negotiations failed, and his fundraising lags far behind. Most race raters place the contest in the Likely to Solid Democratic column, and prediction markets price Haaland's chances above 90 percent. The race remains a clear but not insurmountable Democratic favorite, with room for movement if the campaign dynamic shifts late.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9664, "margin": 10.58}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9571, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9605, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.948, "margin": 10.2}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9415, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9502, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9552, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9463, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9506, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9559, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9507, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9606, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9549, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9273, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9256, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9234, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9241, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9268, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.923, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9163, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9397, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9351, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9301, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.9278, "margin": 8.0}]}